# Btop theme: Matte Black (dark, grayscale with a single orange accent)
# Palette: bg #0d0d0d, fg #d4d4d4, accent #e68e0d, bright orange #f2a52e, rust #c25a3a,
#          grays #3a3a3a #6b6b6e #8a8a8d #a0a0a3 #b0b0b3

